{c_label}Cooldown:{/c_label} {c_resource}{Cooldown Time}{/c_resource} seconds
{if:ADVANCED_TOOLTIP}{c_label}Lucky Hit Chance: {/c}{c_resource}{Combat Effect Chance}%{/c}
{/if}{c_label}Passive{/c}: Abodian bites and claws, dealing {c_number}{payload:TOOLTIP_DEMON_BITE}{/c} damage.

{c_label}Active{/c}: Command Abodian to enter {c_important}{u}Demonform{/u}{/c} for {c_number}{SF_18}{/c} seconds and mount Abodian, gaining {c_number}[{SF_5}*100|x%|]{/c} increased Movement Speed for {c_number}{buffduration:MOUNT_UP}{/c} seconds. While mounted, chain enemies and Pull them behind you, dealing {c_number}{payload:DRAG}{/c} damage every {c_number}[{SF_8}|1|]{/c} seconds. After you dismount, Abodian slams the ground, dealing {c_number}{payload:DEMON_LANDING}{/c} damage.{if:SF_19}

{c_important}{u}Brimstones{/u}{/c} launched deal {c_number}{payload:TOOLTIP_BRIMSTONE}{/c} damage.{/if}

Cast again while active to cancel.
